docs {
  # Batch Confirm Presigned Uploads (Protected)

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/batch/confirm-upload`
  **Auth:** Required (Bearer Token)

  ## Description

  Confirms multiple direct client uploads. Verifies each object in storage, queries file sizes and ETags, and inserts all records in PostgreSQL.

  ## Request

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `items` | `array` | Yes | List of confirmed uploaded items |
  | `items[].object_key` | `string` | Yes | Storage key returned from presigned upload |
  | `items[].original_filename` | `string` | Yes | File name |
  | `items[].type` | `string` | Yes | Attachment type |

  ## Response

  **`201 Created`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "success_count": 1,
      "failure_count": 0,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": 11,
          "original_filename": "gallery_1.jpg",
          "object_key": "attachments/gallery_image/2026/11/abc1_gallery_1.jpg",
          "is_public": true
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```
}
